{"id":"413736d776e8d283","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-metaplectic-group.md","title":"Metaplectic Group","display":"df-metaplectic-group — Metaplectic Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-metaplectic-group","aliases":["58-df-metaplectic-group","Metaplectic Group"],"display":"df-metaplectic-group — Metaplectic Group","depends_on":["[[58-df-double-cover]]","[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","[[58-df-group]]","[[58-df-homomorphism]]","[[58-df-connected]]","[[58-df-smooth]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-metaplectic-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-metaplectic-group</span><span>Metaplectic Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metaplectic-group — Metaplectic Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"08fb6fd463430f87\" href=\"?note=08fb6fd463430f87\" title=\"58-df-double-cover\">58-df-double-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"58-df-smooth-manifold\">58-df-smooth-manifold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed71f39f59370734\" href=\"?note=ed71f39f59370734\" title=\"58-df-group\">58-df-group</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f32a973b59a825e4\" href=\"?note=f32a973b59a825e4\" title=\"58-df-homomorphism\">58-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"71801f5b9407391a\" href=\"?note=71801f5b9407391a\" title=\"58-df-connected\">58-df-connected</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"17de8347f6f91384\" href=\"?note=17de8347f6f91384\" title=\"58-df-smooth\">58-df-smooth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_n=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;I_n\\\\-I_n&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\">\\(J_n=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;I_n\\\\-I_n&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}}\\)</span> is the Euclidean subspace topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_{\\mathrm{mat}}\">\\(\\cdot_{\\mathrm{mat}}\\)</span> is matrix multiplication on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> carries topology <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_M\">\\(\\tau_M\\)</span>, smooth atlas <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_M\">\\(\\mathcal A_M\\)</span>, dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_M\">\\(d_M\\)</span>, multiplication <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot_M\">\\(\\cdot_M\\)</span>, inverse <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_M\">\\(\\iota_M\\)</span>, and identity <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e_M\">\\(e_M\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:M\\to\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\pi:M\\to\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Sp}}\">\\(\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Sp}}\\)</span> is the canonical smooth submanifold atlas of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\)</span>, of dimension <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n(2n+1)\">\\(n(2n+1)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_G^{\\times2}\">\\(\\mathcal A_G^{\\times2}\\)</span> denotes the canonical product atlas.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DoubleCover}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DoubleCover}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Group}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Group}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Connected}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Connected}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in GL_{2n}(\\mathbb R):A^T J_nA=J_n\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}symplectic\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R)\\coloneqq\n\\{A\\in GL_{2n}(\\mathbb R):A^T J_nA=J_n\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,d_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,d_X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,d_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\langle U,U&#39;,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_X\\;\\forall\\langle V,V&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\left[\nU\\cap f^{-1}[V]\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\psi\\circ f\\circ\\varphi^{-1}\\in C^\\infty(\\varphi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],\\mathbb R^{d_Y})\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}smooth\\text{-}map}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,d_X,Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,d_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(X,\\tau_X,\\mathcal A_X,d_X)\\land\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,\\mathcal A_Y,d_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\n\\forall\\langle U,U&#39;,\\varphi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_X\\;\\forall\\langle V,V&#39;,\\psi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A_Y\\;\\left[\nU\\cap f^{-1}[V]\\neq\\varnothing\\to\n\\psi\\circ f\\circ\\varphi^{-1}\\in C^\\infty(\\varphi[U\\cap f^{-1}[V]],\\mathbb R^{d_Y})\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}lie\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d,\\cdot_G,\\iota_G,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_G,G,G)\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gx=x\\land x\\cdot_Ge_G=x\\land x\\cdot_G\\iota_G(x)=e_G\\land\\iota_G(x)\\cdot_Gx=e_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(\\cdot_G,G\\times G,\\tau_G\\times\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G^{\\times2},2d,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(\\iota_G,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}lie\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d,\\cdot_G,\\iota_G,e_G)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{SmoothManifoldStructure}_S(G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\\land\\mathrm{Group}_S(G,\\cdot_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\iota_G,G,G)\\land\\forall x\\in G\\;(e_G\\cdot_Gx=x\\land x\\cdot_Ge_G=x\\land x\\cdot_G\\iota_G(x)=e_G\\land\\iota_G(x)\\cdot_Gx=e_G)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(\\cdot_G,G\\times G,\\tau_G\\times\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G^{\\times2},2d,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(\\iota_G,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}lie\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S(f,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d_G,\\cdot_G,H,\\tau_H,\\mathcal A_H,d_H,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(f,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d_G,H,\\tau_H,\\mathcal A_H,d_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}lie\\text{-}homomorphism}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S(f,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d_G,\\cdot_G,H,\\tau_H,\\mathcal A_H,d_H,\\cdot_H)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{GroupHomomorphism}_S(f,G,\\cdot_G,H,\\cdot_H)\\land\n\\mathrm{SmoothMapBetween}_S(f,G,\\tau_G,\\mathcal A_G,d_G,H,\\tau_H,\\mathcal A_H,d_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S(\\pi,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R),\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}},\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Sp}},n(2n+1),\\cdot_{\\mathrm{mat}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{DoubleCover}_S(\\pi,M,\\tau_M,\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R),\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}})\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}metaplectic\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{MetaplecticGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M,\\pi,n)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land\\mathrm{RealLieGroup}_S(M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\iota_M,e_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Connected}_S(M,\\tau_M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{LieGroupHom}_S(\\pi,M,\\tau_M,\\mathcal A_M,d_M,\\cdot_M,\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R),\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}},\\mathcal A_{\\mathrm{Sp}},n(2n+1),\\cdot_{\\mathrm{mat}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{DoubleCover}_S(\\pi,M,\\tau_M,\\operatorname{Sp}_{2n}(\\mathbb R),\\tau_{\\mathrm{Sp}})\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The general symplectic group is defined for every positive <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>; the former dependency only defined the rank-one group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sp}_2\">\\(\\operatorname{Sp}_2\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Connectedness excludes the split disconnected double cover and singles out the metaplectic covering Lie group.</li>\n<li>Smooth atlases, dimensions, inverse maps, and identity elements are explicit parameters throughout; the chart formula no longer depends on free <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\">\\(\\mathcal A_X,\\mathcal A_Y\\)</span>, or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dim Y\">\\(\\dim Y\\)</span> symbols.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Lion and Vergne, The Weil Representation, Maslov Index and Theta Series</li>\n<li>Gelbart, Automorphic Forms on Adele Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-double-cover","status":"resolved","id":"08fb6fd463430f87","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-double-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth-manifold","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth-manifold]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-group","status":"resolved","id":"ed71f39f59370734","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-group]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"f32a973b59a825e4","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-connected","status":"resolved","id":"71801f5b9407391a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-connected]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-smooth","status":"resolved","id":"17de8347f6f91384","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-smooth]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-functi